{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"chicken_rooster","model_identifier":"chicken_rooster","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# chicken_rooster\n\nRooster (B5), about 50 cm tall to the comb.\n\nBlocky body with a tall red comb and wattles, golden hackles, long dark sickle tail feathers (two-bone tail). Bird rig: root > body > neck > head, body > tail_1 > tail_2, wings, two-joint legs (thigh, shank, toes) with forward knees.\n\n- Cubes: 19 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -4.3..4.3, y -0.0..18.5, z -8.0..11.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 8 x 18 x 15 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop | head turns and tilts (loop) |\n| `walk` | 0.5 | loop | strut with the head bob |\n| `run` | 0.26 | loop | flap-run, body low and forward, wings out |\n| `peck` | 1.2 | once | keys 0.35 s and 0.65 s: beak hits the ground (two pecks) |\n| `flap` | 1 | once | short hop with beating wings, peak 0.42 s, lands 0.88 s |\n| `sit` | 3 | loop | nesting: legs folded, belly on the ground, looking around (loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch, wings flare |\n| `death` | 1.2 | hold | flutters and falls onto its side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 17.8 u/s (0.5 m/s), cycle 0.5 s, 8.9 u per cycle\n- `run`: 71.1 u/s (2.0 m/s), cycle 0.26 s, 18.5 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `peck`: keys 0.35 s and 0.65 s: beak hits the ground (two pecks)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- Tiny model: 1 px per unit still applies, so details are single pixels.\n"},"description":"# chicken_rooster\n\nRooster (B5), about 50 cm tall to the comb.\n\nBlocky body with a tall red comb and wattles, golden hackles, long dark sickle tail feathers (two-bone tail). Bird rig: root > body > neck > head, body > tail_1 > tail_2, wings, two-joint legs (thigh, shank, toes) with forward knees.\n\n- Cubes: 19 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -4.3..4.3, y -0.0..18.5, z -8.0..11.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 8 x 18 x 15 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 3 | loop | head turns and tilts (loop) |\n| `walk` | 0.5 | loop | strut with the head bob |\n| `run` | 0.26 | loop | flap-run, body low and forward, wings out |\n| `peck` | 1.2 | once | keys 0.35 s and 0.65 s: beak hits the ground (two pecks) |\n| `flap` | 1 | once | short hop with beating wings, peak 0.42 s, lands 0.88 s |\n| `sit` | 3 | loop | nesting: legs folded, belly on the ground, looking around (loop) |\n| `injured` | 0.5 | once | flinch, wings flare |\n| `death` | 1.2 | hold | flutters and falls onto its side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 17.8 u/s (0.5 m/s), cycle 0.5 s, 8.9 u per cycle\n- `run`: 71.1 u/s (2.0 m/s), cycle 0.26 s, 18.5 u per cycle\n\n## Key times\n\n- `peck`: keys 0.35 s and 0.65 s: beak hits the ground (two pecks)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Notes\n\n- Tiny model: 1 px per unit still applies, so details are single pixels.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"body","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,5.0,-3.5],"to":[3.5,11.0,4.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,8.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[48,0,55.0,6.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[32,0,40.0,6.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[55,0,62.0,6.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[40,0,48.0,6.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,7